sist joining his old army troop's plot to punish the government. However, in an effort to stop them, Kenshin is forced to take on Sanosuke.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3wZtEMxCHEu7XjrkgFrWCUE2ouA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3wZtEMxCHEu7XjrkgFrWCUE2ouA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/28136/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"703196","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In order to earn money for their dojo, the Peace Force signs on to help protect a merchant ship from pirates. However, to keep Kaoru from falling into the hands of the pirate's female leader, Shura, Kenshin offers himself in exchange.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2xDdGxcw4AkSh1TsQlntedppvQq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2xDdGxcw4AkSh1TsQlntedppvQq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/28136/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"703197","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After Kenshin's kidnapping, a bond begins to develop between him and Shura. However, while Shura is confident in the loyalty of her crew, the profits to be made from dealing opium draws them into a mutinous plan.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1996-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rOkoybZjlsCrSTi7h0sWCMn0kYl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rOkoybZjlsCrSTi7h0sWCMn0kYl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/28136/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"703198","seasonNumber"